@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #43546B
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam componentStyle uml2
title Draft component diagram — proposed architecture
left to right direction
component "Web UI\nVue 3 / TypeScript\nBeybit" as UI
component "CRM API\nFastAPI / Python\nDanial\nAccess, import, jobs, reviews, export" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nCustomers, turns, jobs, runs,\nreviews and audit" as DB
component "Analysis worker\nPython / Akhmediyar\nLease jobs, method adapter,\noutput validation" as Worker
artifact "Pinned local model\nor deterministic baseline" as Model
cloud "Optional hosted model\nDisabled by default" as Hosted
UI --> API : HTTP JSON / polling
API --> DB : SQL transactions
Worker --> DB : SQL leases and immutable runs
Worker --> Model : local inference
Worker ..> Hosted : optional permitted inference
note bottom of Worker
Validate schema and source references.
Bound retries; retain source/config versions.
end note
@enduml
